              "$\\int\\dfrac{1}{\\sin x}dx=\\int\\dfrac{1+u^2}{2u}\\cdot\\dfrac{2}{1+u^2}du=\\int\\dfrac{du}{u}=\\ln|u|+C$",
              "还原：$\\ln|\\tan(x/2)|+C$"
            ]
          }
        ],
